    "detailed_description": "You will manage your fief as a newly appointed knight, and the emperor will evaluate your development status annually to enhance your status.<br />\r\nThe game is a peaceful game, with only the harassment of bandits and beasts, no hostile/competitive forces, and peace of mind for farming.<br />\r\nHousing and Population: Adequate housing space is necessary for population birth and migration.<br />\r\nProduction and Labor: Only adults participate in labor, and a shortage of labor will lead to a decrease in production efficiency<br />\r\nArmy and Soldiers: Recruiting soldiers is done from adults, and the labor force will correspondingly decrease.<br />\r\nBandits and Beasts: Bandits and Beasts will attack your production buildings, disrupt production, and you can send teams to defeat them.<br />\r\nRuins: Occasionally, ruins appear on the map. Send your team to explore and earn rewards.",
